---
import Layout from '../layouts/BreadcrumbLayout.astro';
import ProjectCard from '../components/ProjectCard.astro';
---

<Layout title="about · Partially Ordered" bodyclass="bg-paper-deep">
  <section class="bg-paper w-full flex flex-row flex-wrap justify-center py-16">
    <div class="shrink-0 mx-auto my-4 md:mx-0 max-w-56 size-56"><img class="size-full aspect-square rounded-full shadow-lg" src="/images/satwiwa.png" alt="Joseph Sullivan trail running" />
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 px-4 md:px-10 max-w-120 text-lg leading-8 text-stone-700">
      <h1 class="mt-1 mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Hometown</h1>
      <p>I grew up in <strong>Newbury Park, CA</strong>. It’s a beautiful area and great for trail running. I was on the same cross-country team as <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nico_Young">this olympian</a>, which is my big claim to fame. I was nowhere near as fast—I instead pride myself on my boys JV most-improved award.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-paper-deep w-full flex flex-row flex-wrap justify-center py-16">
    <div class="order-2 md:order-1 flex-1 px-4 md:px-10 max-w-120 text-lg leading-8 text-stone-700">
      <h1 class="mt-1 mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Undergraduate</h1>
      <p>I did my undergrad at <strong>UC Santa Barbara</strong>, within a smaller college called <strong>CCS</strong>. The small accelerated classes in my first years were an awesome advantage. I'm incredibly grateful for the friends I made there, and living on the ocean wasn't bad.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="order-1 md:order-2 shrink-0 mx-auto my-4 md:mx-0 max-w-56 size-56"><img class="size-full aspect-square rounded-full shadow-lg" src="/images/ucsb.png" alt="University of California, Santa Barbara" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-paper w-full flex flex-row flex-wrap justify-center py-16">
    <div class="shrink-0 mx-auto my-4 md:mx-0 max-w-56 size-56"><img class="size-full aspect-square rounded-full shadow-lg" src="/images/uofu.png" alt="University of Utah" />
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 px-4 md:px-10 max-w-120 text-lg leading-8 text-stone-700">
      <h1 class="mt-1 mb-6 text-4xl font-semibold text-stone-900">Graduate</h1>
      <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-stone-700">Right now I’m a graduate student at the <strong>University of Utah</strong> working with <strong>Aaron Bertram</strong>. I study derived categories of coherent sheaves, particularly semiorthogonal decompositions and Bridgeland stability.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-paper-deep">
    <div class="content-width px-6 py-16"><h2 class="section-title">Hobbies</h2><div class="mt-8 content-width grid justify-items-center"><ProjectCard project={{ name: 'Guitar', description: 'I started on electric guitar at the end of 2018, but now I’m more into acoustic. My music taste ranges from indie rock to midwest emo, math rock, and singer-songwriter.', image: '/images/guitar.png' }} /></div></div>
  </section>
</Layout>
